        self.person = person

    def describe_evening(self):
        return "The average evening of " + self.person + " is filled with activities."
```
Yeh class ek person ko as an argument leti hai aur ismein ek `describe_evening` method hai jo ek string return karta hai jo us person ki average evening ko describe karta hai.

